                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Poor mans version of The Labs archery game.\n\nI was hoping that it would be like a full version of that game but fails in comparison.\n\nYou get 2 cross bows in the game - one long bow (which shoots 1 arrow) and one cross bos (which if you hold the trigger button down, three arrows are fired).\n\nYou basically have to protect this large crystal from being smashed (i.e. protect the gate). You have enemies approach from different locations as well (like The Lab). However, the enemies take a few arrows to shoot down. You regenerate the crystal by shooting fish in the pond in game (compared to shooting balloons).\n\nThe game is  OK but dont expect to be playing The Labs archery game which I did. I couldnt play it more than 10 minutes.\n\nI would like to see both bows have better traction and the enemies a 1 shot 1 kill sort of thing.\n\n",
                        "timestamp_created": 1485437795,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1485437795,
